From 26be5450963cf3582299a45ac09dd7ae514d83f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z <z@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:35:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] WhatsApp-style DMs: full chat page with media, voice
 notes and attachments

- /messages/[id] renders the new ChatClient: bubbles, realtime thread via
  postgres_changes, read receipts (mark_thread_read), friend actions in header
- direct_messages gains an attachments jsonb column (image/video/audio/file,
  same shape as space_posts); body becomes optional when media is attached
  (20261102000005_dm_rich_media.sql, idempotent, to_regclass-guarded)
- media/voice notes upload through the existing MediaComposer + space-media
  bucket under dm/
- Friends list contact button now opens the chat directly; /messages?to=
  deep links redirect to /messages/[id]; conversations list navigates there
- new i18n keys (en/ar/fr): friends.contact, page.chat.*, chat.*
